@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Lexical analysis result values
hide empty members
class "pydantic.BaseModel" as BaseModel <<external>> {
  model_validate(value) {inherited}
  model_dump() {inherited}
}
class TokenResult {
  text: str
  category: str
}
class AnalysisResult {
  code_mixed_spans: list[str]
  verb_phrases: list[str]
}
TokenResult --|> BaseModel
AnalysisResult --|> BaseModel
AnalysisResult "0..*" --> "0..*" TokenResult : tokens
note bottom of AnalysisResult
  Nested Pydantic values may be reused by Python callers:
  this is an association, not exclusive composition.
  Token strings preserve observed wording.
  Code-mixed spans and verb phrases are heuristic annotations.
end note
legend bottom
  Both primary classes live in backend.schemas.
  Grammar analyses, parse traces and corpus reports are dictionaries, not hidden DTO classes.
  No translation, provider-evidence or generated-reply classes remain.
endlegend
@enduml
